# Fanny, Blade Dancer

> Fanny does not walk. The moment she stops flying, she stops being Fanny. Every other assassin approaches from bushes or fog, but Fanny approaches from the air, and the mechanical demands of keeping her airborne are why most players who lock her end up feeding.

