### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the main interruption threat is physical damage rather than chain crowd control.; Queen's Wings over Blade of Despair when Use when Fanny needs damage reduction and spell vamp more than a final burst slot.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against front-loaded magic burst that can kill Fanny before the reset path is available.
- Total cost: 11850 gold

Default jungle setup for pickoff games where Fanny can isolate side-lane targets, cash in Prey Mark damage, then reset with blue buff control.

### Sustain Cable Bruiser (Jungle)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when suppressions, stuns, or slows are the reason cable exits fail.; Athena's Shield over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against burst mages who force Fanny to leave before War Axe and Queen's Wings can work.; Sea Halberd over Immortality when Use when allied anti-heal is missing and a healer or shield core keeps surviving cable passes.
- Total cost: 11120 gold

Bruiser jungle setup for CC-light drafts where Fanny can pass through the same fight repeatedly instead of relying on one clean execute.

### Snowball Execute (Jungle)

