- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use once shutdown risk is higher than the value of the last burst item.; Queen's Wings over Blade of Despair when Use when Fanny is ahead but still has to survive unavoidable counter-burst after diving.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use when magic burst is the only thing stopping snowball dives and Immortality is not yet needed.
- Total cost: 11230 gold

High-risk snowball setup for games where Fanny gets early kills, protects Sky Piercer stacks, and can end before grouped late-game fights.

